# ---- registry export (optional, BH-5651) ----
# bin/registry-export.sh --snapshot (cron 41 3 * * *, hub only) writes a dated
# snapshot of the D1 fleet registry under state/registry/export/ for humans and
# disaster recovery (docs/RESTORE.md). Three failed nights in a row write one
# ALERTS line. Off via flags/lane-off-registry-export.
# How many snapshots to keep; 0 or a non-number also means 14.
#REGISTRY_EXPORT_KEEP=14
